#. Translators: the first line of a post that invites people to ask
#. the author questions; a link and a hashtag follow it. Na Real is
#. the name of a service.
#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:220
msgid "Ask me anything, anonymously, on Na Real:"
msgstr "Fragen Sie mich alles, anonym, auf Na Real:"

#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:300
msgid "Na Real needs JavaScript. Turn it on in Preferences."
msgstr "Na Real benötigt JavaScript. Aktivieren Sie es in den Einstellungen."

#. Translators: shown when the Na Real page does not tell
#. Babble the user's link. Na Real is the name of a service.
#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:325
msgid "Couldn’t read your Na Real link."
msgstr "Ihr Na-Real-Link konnte nicht gelesen werden."

#. Translators: a main menu entry that opens the user's
#. questions on Na Real; the underscore marks the access key.
#. Na Real is the name of a service.
#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:353
msgid "My _Questions"
msgstr "Meine _Fragen"

#. Translators: a main menu entry that starts a post with the
#. user's Na Real link; the underscore marks the access key.
#. Na Real is the name of a service.
#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:357
msgid "_Share My Questions Link"
msgstr "Meinen Fragen-Link _teilen"

#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:366
msgid "Sign in to Babble first."
msgstr "Melden Sie sich zuerst bei Babble an."

#. Na Real has never seen this user: signing in from the
#. dashboard is what creates the page.
#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:377
msgid "You are not on Na Real yet. Sign in from My Questions first."
msgstr ""
"Sie sind noch nicht auf Na Real. Melden Sie sich zuerst über „Meine Fragen“ "
"an."

#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:405
msgid "Anonymous questions for the fediverse"
msgstr "Anonyme Fragen für das Fediverse"

#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:408
msgid "Open Na Real"
msgstr "Na Real öffnen"

#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:438
msgid ""
"Na Real is run by each community on its own server. Enter the address of the "
"one you use."
msgstr ""
"Na Real wird von jeder Community auf ihrem eigenen Server betrieben. Geben "
"Sie die Adresse des von Ihnen genutzten Servers ein."

#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:448
msgid ""
"Added to the invitation you share from the main menu, and the hashtag that "
"shows the Na Real banner."
msgstr ""
"Hinzugefügt zur Einladung, die Sie über das Hauptmenü teilen, und zum "
"Hashtag, der das Na-Real-Banner anzeigt."

#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:474
msgid "That is your own server. Use the address of a Na Real server."
msgstr ""
"Das ist Ihr eigener Server. Verwenden Sie die Adresse eines Na-Real-Servers."

#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:485
msgid "Na Real server saved"
msgstr "Na-Real-Server gespeichert"

#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:491
msgid "Use a single hashtag, without spaces"
msgstr "Einen einzelnen Hashtag verwenden, ohne Leerzeichen"

#: plugins/nareal/babble_nareal.py:501
msgid "Na Real hashtag saved"
msgstr "Na-Real-Hashtag gespeichert"

